╭ Proxie│ Grid state: up green, dropped yellow, connecting blue, dead red.                │10/65536│
│up     │ Parked is dim. Green brightness is throughput.                                  │        │
│dropped│ A bright dot fades after recent traffic. proxy.afterglow_seconds sets the time. │        │
│connect│ One dot is one proxy. A cell has upper and lower dots.                          │────────╯
│dead   │ Groups show the worst state. Hover or click for addresses.                      │
╰───────│ Mono uses blocks. Colorblind uses blocks and the worst state style.             │
